This crate (`symphonia-codec-opus`) is a from-scratch, pure-Rust reimplementation of the Opus
audio codec's decoder. It is licensed under the Mozilla Public License, v. 2.0, like the rest of
Project Symphonia (see `LICENSE`).

Portions of this crate's algorithms (the range coder, TOC/packet framing, SILK decoder, and CELT
decoder) are ported, function-by-function, from the reference `libopus` implementation
(https://opus-codec.org/, https://gitlab.xiph.org/xiph/opus), which is distributed under the
