# Convention for ported files

Every source file in this crate that ports algorithmic logic from `libopus` carries a header
comment of the form:

    Ported from libopus <path/to/file.c> (BSD-3-Clause), see NOTICE.

pointing back to this file. Files that only define Symphonia-specific glue (trait impls,
`AudioDecoder` registration, etc.) do not carry this notice.
